&lt;p&gt;This session will focus on how to get Workbench working, what can it do &quot;out of the box&quot; and how we can alter the default settings to serve our purposes. All seen from a live demo.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At the end of the session some guidelines will be given to developers to develop modules that integrate to the suite.&lt;/p&gt;
